# MilkDrop Pack Import — Research & Feature Spec

Status: **✅ Phase 0 SHIPPED & VERIFIED (storage upgrade — custom presets now on IndexedDB; localStorage wall gone). Community packs (Phase 1+) not started.**
Last updated: 2026-06-02

> Goal: Expand the existing import modal to let users browse and install curated
> MilkDrop preset packs directly from GitHub — turning DiscoCast into a platform
> where users can stack thousands (even tens of thousands) of additional presets
> with a single click.

> **2026-06-02 headline:** The codebase audit (§0, §11) confirmed a storage upgrade
> we need **regardless of community packs** — custom preset *metadata* still lives
> in localStorage and already throws "Storage full" at users. That upgrade is now
> **Phase 0** (a unified IndexedDB preset store), and community packs plug into it.

