## 2. Available Preset Packs — The Landscape

### Tier 1: Ready-to-Use (Butterchurn JSON — drop-in compatible)

These are **already in Butterchurn JSON format** — the exact format our engine
consumes. No conversion needed.

| Pack | Source | Presets | Format | License | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Official Butterchurn** | [jberg/butterchurn-presets](https://github.com/jberg/butterchurn-presets) | ~1,100+ | JS bundles (JSON presets) | MIT | Already bundled in our app (Base/Extra/Extra2/MD1). Files live in `presets/` dir as individual JSON. |
| **Baron Community Pack** | `butterchurn-presets-baron` (npm) | ~762 | Individual JSON files | MIT | Already bundled via `import.meta.glob`. JSON files at `dist/presets/*.json`. |
| **⭐ Ansorre Mega Collection** | [ansorre/tens-of-thousands-milkdrop-presets-for-butterchurn](https://github.com/ansorre/tens-of-thousands-milkdrop-presets-for-butterchurn) | **15,056** | ZIP containing JSON | Public | **This is the goldmine.** Pre-converted using the native mojoshader path (higher fidelity than browser converter). Single ZIP: `milkdrop-presets-for-butterchurn.zip`. Growing collection. |

### Tier 2: Raw .milk Files (Require Conversion)

These are in native MilkDrop format and need the `milkdrop-preset-converter`
pipeline (milkdrop-import-dev.md Phase 1–3).

| Pack | Source | Presets | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Cream of the Crop** | [projectM-visualizer/presets-cream-of-the-crop](https://github.com/projectM-visualizer/presets-cream-of-the-crop) | **9,795** | Gold standard curated pack by Jason Fletcher (ISOSCELES). Every preset hand-tested and rated 5/5. Organized into 11 categories: Dancer, Drawing, Fractal, Geometric, Hypnotic, Particles, Reaction, Sparkle, Supernova, Waveform, Transition. Default pack for projectM. |
| **Original MilkDrop** | [projectM-visualizer/presets-milkdrop-original](https://github.com/projectM-visualizer/presets-milkdrop-original) | ~400 | The original presets shipped with Winamp's MilkDrop 1/2. Historical/nostalgic value. |
| **MilkDrop 3.0** | [milkdrop2077/MilkDrop3](https://github.com/milkdrop2077/MilkDrop3) | Large bundle | Modern presets with advanced shader support. Contains `.milk2` double-preset format — our converter can't handle these. |
| **MilkDrop Texture Pack** | [projectM-visualizer/presets-milkdrop-texture-pack](https://github.com/projectM-visualizer/presets-milkdrop-texture-pack) | Textures only | Image assets required by some presets. Not presets themselves, but a dependency for full-fidelity rendering. |
| **WACUP MegaPacks** | [WACUP Forums](https://getwacup.com/) | **100,000+** | Community mega-packs (Incubo's packs). Uncurated, massive. .milk format. |
| **Internet Archive** | [archive.org — Milkdrop 52k Collection](https://archive.org/details/milkdrop-2-52k-preset-collection) | 52,000+ | Archived mega-collection. .milk format. |

### Summary of scale

| Scenario | Presets available | Conversion needed? |
|---|---|---|
| Ansorre JSON pack only | **15,056** | ❌ None — drop-in JSON |
| + Cream of the Crop | **+9,795** | ✅ .milk → JSON (browser converter) |
| + Original MilkDrop | **+400** | ✅ .milk → JSON |
| + WACUP MegaPack | **+100,000** | ✅ .milk → JSON |
| **Maximum potential** | **125,000+** | Mixed |

**Key insight:** The Ansorre pack alone gives us 15,056 pre-converted, drop-in
presets with zero conversion cost. That's the low-hanging fruit.

