### Phase 4 — Polish

- **Tauri FS fallback:** Store community preset JSONs in
  `~/Library/Application Support/com.discocast.app/community/` alongside
  IndexedDB. Mirror the `_storeImageTauri` / `_getImageTauri` pattern from
  `customPresets.js`.
- **Deduplication:** Skip community presets whose names match bundled ones (by
  display name, case-insensitive). Or auto-prefix: "ansorre-mega: Preset Name".
- **User Guide:** Add "Community Packs" section to help modal (index.html + help.html).
- **Pack update detection:** Compare manifest `version` field with stored
  `installedAt` to show "Update available" badge.
- **Drawer UI:** Add a "Community" tab or a section divider in the drawer so
  users can filter/search community presets separately.

